summary:
  The relay's quiet re-arm runs without asking whether the order lapsed.

history:
  A relayed station whose writer died overnight came back up on waking
  through the engine's own re-arm, with nobody asking.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
                      && _relayRestarts < 3 && !app._orderLapsed()) {

replace:
                      && _relayRestarts < 3) {

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_timeshiftengine.qml::test_a_lapsed_order_does_not_rearm_a_capped_writer.
  Line-neutral.
